{
    "title": "Aged Color",
    "description": "Aged Color is a free color by number game for people of all ages and lifestyles. Featuring tons of inspiring pictures, you will enjoy a relaxing and interesting experience.\r\n\r\nWhat to Color?\r\nOur app offers thousands of exquisite pictures produced by professional artists worldwide and beautiful images are updated every day for you to color them and relax your mind!\r\n\r\nThere are more than 30 categories for your choice, such as\r\n- Animal: You can find cute pets, lovely animals you can only see in zoos, and various  animals in the wild.\r\n- People: There are attractive and interesting people here.\r\n- Flower: You can see beautiful flowers which can relieve your stress and make you happy physically and mentally.\r\n- Place: Like travelling over the world, you can see various and impressive styles of architecture.\r\n- Nature: You can feel like you are in the splendid nature and witness the beauty of nature.\r\nMandalas, \ufe0fHearts, Fashion, Pattern, Vehicle, Holidays, Food and many surprises await you!\r\n\r\nHow to Color?\r\nSuper easy! Just follow the numbers and tap to color. You can create an incredible masterpiece and bring it to life in a short time!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nConvenient and user-friendly: Start to color painting anytime and anywhere. No pencil or paper is needed, and no specific skills are required!\r\n\r\nFascinating pictures and daily updated: A large range of pictures to choose from and unique coloring images updated every day!\r\n\r\nVarious themes for all tastes: Animals, Places, Nature, Mandalas, People, Fashion, Foods, Pattern and many more!\r\n\r\nSave as favorite and color later: When you explore to find pics you love, you can save them as favorites first, and color them later when you are available.\r\n\r\nTell others your thoughts: After completing a picture, you can post your comment, like the pic, and reply to others\u2019 comments to express your thoughts and feelings.\r\n\r\nShare and save your artwork: You can share your completed pics on social media, like Facebook. Also, you can download and save them to your device.\r\n\r\nRecommended coloring pages: Help you choose pictures that you may be interested in and start coloring easily.\r\n\r\nPersonal profile: Make more people know about you. Your profile will display your nickname, profile photo, bio, game achievements, statistics, and albums of paintings like Completed, Favorite, and Collected pictures. Also, you can check how many friends, followers, completed pictures and likes you have.\r\n\r\nChat with friends: Directly send texts, pics and videos to your friends in our app. You do not need to switch to other apps to chat with your friends. Besides, search function helps you quickly add friends and find the one you want to message. How convenient!\r\n\r\nMeet new friends: Leave a message and share your experience with others, you can meet like-minded players all over the world. Also, \u201cSuggested Friends\u201d feature recommends lists of people you might want to add as friends.\r\n\r\nFollowings and Feeds: You can follow your friends and favorite players to keep track of your following's latest, such as their current coloring page and new achievement.\r\n\r\nStress relief and other benefits: Enjoy art therapy to reduce stress and anxiety. It's also a great way to enhance focus, motor skills and creativity.\r\n\r\nRelax and entertain yourself with color therapy now! It's time to explore fabulous paintings and enjoy your coloring journey in Aged Color!\r\n\r\nTo ensure that you can save and share pictures successfully, we need to access photos, media and files on your device. To permanently save all your painting progresses, we would recommend you log in and bind your account. You can see more details of app permissions in App info of Google Play.\r\n\r\nWe do not sell any personal information you provide, nor do we share your private information without your consent. Thanks for your understanding and we are dedicated to a better coloring experience!\r\n\r\nWe are willing to hear your feedback: support@agedstudio.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Aged Color is a free color by number game for people of all ages and lifestyles. Featuring tons of inspiring pictures, you will enjoy a relaxing and interesting experience.<br><br>What to Color?<br>Our app offers thousands of exquisite pictures produced by professional artists worldwide and beautiful images are updated every day for you to color them and relax your mind!<br><br>There are more than 30 categories for your choice, such as<br>- Animal: You can find cute pets, lovely animals you can only see in zoos, and various  animals in the wild.<br>- People: There are attractive and interesting people here.<br>- Flower: You can see beautiful flowers which can relieve your stress and make you happy physically and mentally.<br>- Place: Like travelling over the world, you can see various and impressive styles of architecture.<br>- Nature: You can feel like you are in the splendid nature and witness the beauty of nature.<br>Mandalas, \ufe0fHearts, Fashion, Pattern, Vehicle, Holidays, Food and many surprises await you!<br><br>How to Color?<br>Super easy! Just follow the numbers and tap to color. You can create an incredible masterpiece and bring it to life in a short time!<br><br>Key Features:<br>Convenient and user-friendly: Start to color painting anytime and anywhere. No pencil or paper is needed, and no specific skills are required!<br><br>Fascinating pictures and daily updated: A large range of pictures to choose from and unique coloring images updated every day!<br><br>Various themes for all tastes: Animals, Places, Nature, Mandalas, People, Fashion, Foods, Pattern and many more!<br><br>Save as favorite and color later: When you explore to find pics you love, you can save them as favorites first, and color them later when you are available.<br><br>Tell others your thoughts: After completing a picture, you can post your comment, like the pic, and reply to others\u2019 comments to express your thoughts and feelings.<br><br>Share and save your artwork: You can share your completed pics on social media, like Facebook. Also, you can download and save them to your device.<br><br>Recommended coloring pages: Help you choose pictures that you may be interested in and start coloring easily.<br><br>Personal profile: Make more people know about you. Your profile will display your nickname, profile photo, bio, game achievements, statistics, and albums of paintings like Completed, Favorite, and Collected pictures. Also, you can check how many friends, followers, completed pictures and likes you have.<br><br>Chat with friends: Directly send texts, pics and videos to your friends in our app. You do not need to switch to other apps to chat with your friends. Besides, search function helps you quickly add friends and find the one you want to message. How convenient!<br><br>Meet new friends: Leave a message and share your experience with others, you can meet like-minded players all over the world. Also, \u201cSuggested Friends\u201d feature recommends lists of people you might want to add as friends.<br><br>Followings and Feeds: You can follow your friends and favorite players to keep track of your following&#39;s latest, such as their current coloring page and new achievement.<br><br>Stress relief and other benefits: Enjoy art therapy to reduce stress and anxiety. It&#39;s also a great way to enhance focus, motor skills and creativity.<br><br>Relax and entertain yourself with color therapy now! It&#39;s time to explore fabulous paintings and enjoy your coloring journey in Aged Color!<br><br>To ensure that you can save and share pictures successfully, we need to access photos, media and files on your device. To permanently save all your painting progresses, we would recommend you log in and bind your account. You can see more details of app permissions in App info of Google Play.<br><br>We do not sell any personal information you provide, nor do we share your private information without your consent. Thanks for your understanding and we are dedicated to a better coloring experience!<br><br>We are willing to hear your feedback: support@agedstudio.com",
